  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of emergency assistance to IDPs in Lviv and Eastern Oblasts of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project foresees A) the continuation of the running of 2 transit shelters in Lviv and, implemented by the local partner 100% Life, B) Rapid Response Mechanisms in Kharkiv and Eastern Oblasts where INTERSOS is present, as well as Distribution of winter items (blankets, dry food, winter clothes) to collective shelters in Dnipropetrovska and Eastern Oblasts. Through the set-up of a Rapid Response team, INTERSOS will also increase its capacity in responding to sudden emergencies in such a volatile context.</narrative>
  </description>
